Subject: [PATCH v2 kbuild for-next 2/2] modpost: add Kconfig option to report warnings as errors
Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2015 10:51:11 -0700
Message-Id: <1427478671-16379-2-git-send-email-jtoppins@cumulusnetworks.com>
In-Reply-To: <1427478671-16379-1-git-send-email-jtoppins@cumulusnetworks.com>
